  "scope_limits": [
    "Stopped single-virtual-CPU supported QEMU profile only; accepted states are PAUSED, DEBUG, and PRELAUNCH.",
    "Preserves explicit held key makes/breaks only. Native typematic repeat is unsupported and repeat-supported is false.",
    "Only a uniquely selected realized PS/2 keyboard on ISA i8042 is supported. Other input plans must be inactive; foreign keyboard events invalidate an active owner.",
    "Batch grammar is limited to 32 edges and 64 held keys; actual capacity is two edges when the PS/2 FIFO and i8042 output are quiescent, zero otherwise. Preflight failure dispatches no edge.",
    "The native owner blocks generic migration; use instrumented checkpoint export/load. Old v1 state remains importable only under its legacy constraints; new exports use format v2.",
